<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
            To democratize executive culinary wisdom by translating elite fine-dining methodologies into approachable, repeatable rituals for passionate home cooks and emerging professionals across the globe.
          </p>
<div class="space-y-space-sm pt-space-xs">
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px] shrink-0 mt-1">check_circle</span>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">Demystifying master sauce-making, knife proficiency, and balanced flavor science.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px] shrink-0 mt-1">check_circle</span>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">Fostering respectful ingredient sourcing, culinary self-reliance, and sustainable pantry management.</p>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<!-- Vision Card -->
<article class="relative group bg-surface-container/75 backdrop-blur-xl p-space-xl rounded-xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-surface-container-high/80">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-lg">
<div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/40 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(154,211,179,0.2)]">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[30px]">visibility</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary px-space-sm py-space-xs rounded-full bg-secondary/10">02 / Horizon</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-space-sm tracking-tight">Our Vision</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
            To cultivate a boundary-free global sanctuary where domestic kitchens mirror the poise, artistry, and joyful precision of the world's most revered dining rooms, united by culinary passion.
          </p>
<div class="space-y-space-sm pt-space-xs">
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px] shrink-0 mt-1">lens_blur</span>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">A universal culinary forum where regional traditions converse harmoniously with classical technique.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px] shrink-0 mt-1">lens_blur</span>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">Empowering next-generation culinary storytellers through open feedback and friendly competitive showcases.</p>
</div>
</div>
</article>
</section>
